Package: iputils-arping
Version: s20121221-r0
Description: Network monitoring tools
 Utilities for the IP protocol, including traceroute6, tracepath,
 tracepath6, ping, ping6 and arping.
Section: console/network
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Poky <poky@yoctoproject.org>
License: BSD & GPLv2+
Architecture: cortexa9-vfp-neon
OE: iputils
Homepage: http://www.skbuff.net/iputils
Depends: libcap2 (>= 2.24), libc6 (>= 2.21)
Source: http://www.skbuff.net/iputils/iputils-s20121221.tar.bz2 file://debian/use_gethostbyname2.diff file://debian/targets.diff file://nsgmls-path-fix.patch file://fix-build-command-line-argument-with-gnutls.patch
